_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRRIHF2lmptbSddRlQZiRTnCVZ0RyIpzT4sjrhfdn8cWg&oe=6AFF21C4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\u30cf\u30b3\u3081\u3044\u308dVR2(Box Maze VR2)", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Summary\nSolve mazes like never before in VR! Hako Meiro VR is a unique puzzle game where the maze is drawn on the surface of a 3D object. Your goal is simple: trace the path and reach the finish line. But there\u2019s a twist\u2014since it\u2019s a solid object, you can\u2019t see the whole path at once!\n\nHow to Play\nRotate and Explore: Grab and rotate the box to see it from every angle. Hidden paths are waiting to be discovered on the back and sides.\n\nTrace the Path: Carefully navigate the 3D surface to find your way to the goal.\n\nUnlock the Surprise: Once you reach the goal, watch as a special CG model pops out from inside the box!\n\nKey Features\nSpatial Puzzle Experience: Enhances your spatial awareness as you manipulate objects in 3D space.\n\nIntuitive Controls: Designed for VR\u2014simply grab, rotate, and trace.\n\nSatisfying Rewards: A fun variety of CG surprises await you at the end of every maze.\n\nCan you find the path to the goal? Spin the box and start the challenge today!", "short_description": "Play the box maze!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/mazeboxvr2/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "\u4e09\u6b21\u5143\u8ff7\u8def\u5de5\u623f", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/mazeboxvr2/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": 